Z||000049||gusto||12-19-2001||03:45 PM||||   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Blacktree:<BR>  <HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>To each his/her own.<BR>B][/QUOTE]<P>True, I happen to think just about everything you guys named is crap, but I wouldn't say that to you. Being in the minority(inner-city black youth), I'm assuming that by pics posted and other things, that there are not many fiero owners "like" me on this forum. I try not to openly offen anyone with ignorant comments. All I was saying is that I would appreciate it if Orodovician did the same. Orodovician's comment didn't upset me. I just want people to think before they click. I also want to point out that I can't take Orodovician's post personaly because it wasn't directed at me. Even though it was posted after my first comment, I'm sure it had nothing to do with me saying I liked rap.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> Your comment, on the other hand, was directed at me. But anyway, my point is I watch what I say here and try not offend anyone, there are people on this forum who should try to do the same. The only thing we all have in common is our love of fieros. Ok I'm done with this, I've said my peace.                                                                                                                         -Thanks<P>[This message has been edited by gusto (edited 12-19-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by gusto (edited 12-19-2001).]||||reg||1
