Z||000051||Doni Hagan||12-19-2001||09:23 PM||||GUSTO, <P>Chill, 'lil brother....No one would've even known you were Black if you had'nt said it yourself. Calling rap music junk isn't a personal attack...but calling someone a "dumbass" is. <P>You're not the only African-American on PFF. I am, for one, and know of at least 8 others. But so what? As a Black man who probably has some years on 'ya, I have to deal with issues of race every day of my life. I view this Forum as a DMZ of sorts. I log on here and one thing and one thing ONLY matters.....I drive a Pontiac Fiero. Period. Besides, liking or disliking a particular genre of music doesn't make one evil....just different. <P>Anyway, I didn't mean to preach at'cha...I guess seeing a reference to color caught me off guard here. I hadn't seen it before but I guess there's a first time for everything. I'll admit I'm a bit disappointed it had to be from one of my peeps.<P>Peace back at 'cha... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
