Z||000054||gusto||12-21-2001||03:36 AM||||Sorry to be getting off the subject again, but Doni, you completely missed the point. Never once did I say I was upset, actually I said I was not. Did you even read my post? I said I did NOT consider his comment an insult. I just want people to think before they post something that could be remotely offenseive. Now maybe I should not have called him a dumbass, I could have "enlightened" him (and others) in a different, more polite way. For that I will apoligize. Also I never said I was the only one, I said judging by pics(among other things) I figured I was in the minority, and you saying you know of atleast 8 others confirms it. Hmmm....Thats 8 out of how many??? (retorical and extremely sarcastic question) I also said The ONLY thing we all have in common is our love of the fiero. That includes us, you know nothing about me, and looking at your top ten I'm pretty sure we are nothing alike. I never said people who like rock, metal, techno, ect. were evil. Now what I did say, or atleast attended to say was I try to respect everyone, thats all I ask, or if need be demand, in return. If you didn't get that from my reply to Blacktree there is something wrong with you not me. Maybe you should have read it 5,6,7, or how ever many times it takes you to comprehend before you decide to type something thats makes no sense. I am not, I repeat NOT one of your "peeps", I don't even know you. And no one, especially me, cares if your dissapointed. I'm sure you saying you have to deal with race issues everyday because your older was just a typo, right? It just sounded different in your head,... right? If anything I deal with it more than you. Being young, black, intellegent, and from the "hood"(South Memphis A.K.A. Funky Town), I get problems from both "sides". My peers think I'm not "black" enough(and no I'm not "mixed"), and the only thing  some(not all, SOME) white people see is a young black man. We don't like to think about it, but believe me it is very true, and happens daily. Ok, what was my point.... I know I had a point at first....oh yeah....we are all different, what one person says  everyday to their friends/family may offend someone else. Think before you post. Now once again I'm done with this. Leave the subject alone. Thanks for putting up with the ravings of a madman. If anyone else has any thing else to say on this subject e-mail me. This is not the place to discuss this. PERIOD.                                                                                                                        -Thanks<p>[This message has been edited by gusto (edited 12-21-2001).]||||reg||1
